# Phase 6 baseline manifest
# Deterministic file list (LC_ALL=C path-sorted) with SHA-256 hashes over the committed Git blob content (not the
# Windows checkout bytes), covering the complete Phase 6 implementation baseline set: the input reconstruction
# production sources (anticheat-simulation: InputDomain, TickObservation, ReconstructionRequest/Result,
# InputReconstructor, Interval, AbstractState, AbstractTransfer), the P6-F1 forward correction of the Phase 5 client
# input pipeline (PhysicsKernels.clientMoveVector, PhysicsSimulator, MovementProfile constants) with the oracle glue
# that mirrors it, the version-scoped observation profile, core composition (PacketEngine, PhysicsQualification
# scenarios, ReconstructionEngineStatus, ReconstructionTracer), the platform diagnostic command, tests (domain,
# observation, reconstructor, M3 containment, round trip, multi-tick, native reconstruction gate, property, fixtures,
# tracer, ArchitectureTest), the native lane change, benchmarks, the memory/distribution/fixture harnesses, Gradle
# task changes, the Phase 6 report, the human approval record, and the artifacts (input domain, candidate
# distribution, native reconstruction results, native differential + multi-tick drift + pinned trajectories re-pinned
# under P6-F1, reconstruction fixtures, benchmarks (final-code run and the pre-P6-F1 run), memory results,
# verification.json, and the real-client evidence log).
# The frozen Phase 0-5 documents and docs/phase5-artifacts are intentionally NOT part of this manifest: P6-F1 is a
# forward correction; the Phase 5 historical baseline and its artifacts are unchanged.
